 {
  "file": "hc",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "model": "eleven_v3",
  "stability": 0.0,
  "text": "[excited] Islam is so [shouting] STRANGE!"
 },
 {
  "file": "c1",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "And the Prophet, peace be upon him, told us it would be.",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "r1",
  "voice": "Ywuz3KyW2N5pqKNpwcCL",
  "text": "بَدَأَ الإِسْلامُ غَرِيبًا، وَسَيَعُودُ كَما بَدَأَ غَرِيبًا، فَطُوبى لِلْغُرَباءِ",
  "stability": 0.6,
  "style": 0.1,
  "speed": 0.85
 },
 {
  "file": "c2",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "Islam began as something strange, and it will return to being strange, as it began. So glad tidings to the strangers.",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "c3",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "Let's zoom in on that last word.",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "r2",
  "voice": "Ywuz3KyW2N5pqKNpwcCL",
  "text": "غُرَباء",
  "stability": 0.6,
  "style": 0.1,
  "speed": 0.9
 },
 {
  "file": "c4",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "Ghuraba means strangers. Just one stranger is a ghareeb.",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "r3",
  "voice": "Ywuz3KyW2N5pqKNpwcCL",
  "text": "غَرِيب",
  "stability": 0.6,
  "style": 0.1,
  "speed": 0.9
 },
 {
  "file": "c5",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "Now break it down to its root. Three letters.",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "r4",
  "voice": "Ywuz3KyW2N5pqKNpwcCL",
  "text": "غَيْن، راء، باء",
  "stability": 0.6,
  "style": 0.1,
  "speed": 0.85
 },
 {
  "file": "c6",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "They mean to go away, like the sun when it sets.",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "c7",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "That's why the sunset prayer is called Maghrib.",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "r5",
  "voice": "Ywuz3KyW2N5pqKNpwcCL",
  "text": "الْمَغْرِب",
  "stability": 0.6,
  "style": 0.1,
  "speed": 0.9
 },
 {
  "file": "c8",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "The west is gharb, where the sun goes away.",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "r6",
  "voice": "Ywuz3KyW2N5pqKNpwcCL",
  "text": "غَرْب",
  "stability": 0.6,
  "style": 0.1,
  "speed": 0.9
 },
 {
  "file": "c9",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "And ghurba is the feeling of being far from home.",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "r7",
  "voice": "Ywuz3KyW2N5pqKNpwcCL",
  "text": "غُرْبَة",
  "stability": 0.6,
  "style": 0.1,
  "speed": 0.9
 },
 {
  "file": "c10",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "So a stranger is simply someone far from home. And the Prophet, peace be upon him, said:",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "r8",
  "voice": "Ywuz3KyW2N5pqKNpwcCL",
  "text": "كُنْ فِي الدُّنْيا كَأَنَّكَ غَرِيبٌ أَوْ عابِرُ سَبِيلٍ",
  "stability": 0.6,
  "style": 0.1,
  "speed": 0.85
 },
 {
  "file": "c11",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "Be in this world as if you were a stranger, or a traveller.",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "c12",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "text": "Are you one of the strangers? Comment down below!",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 }
]